{"id":"event_redash1_03_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40031","label":"RED ASH · Part 1"},"label":"Red and White: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_redash1_02_e","next":"event_redash1_03_e","speakers":{"liliweiss":"Liliweiss","redhood":"Red Hood","commander":"Commander","dorothy":"Dorothy","rapunzel_o":"Rapunzel","snowwhite_o":"Snow White","hongryeon_o":"Scarlet","liliweiss_op":"Liliweiss","snowwhite_op":"Snow White"},"icons":{"liliweiss":"si_c943_00_s","redhood":"si_c470_00_s","commander":"si_c942_00_s","dorothy":"si_c233_00_s","rapunzel_o":"si_c966_00_s","snowwhite_o":"si_c224_00_s","hongryeon_o":"si_c225_00_s","liliweiss_op":"si_c943_00_s","snowwhite_op":"si_c224_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_1","text":"The following morning.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BattleShipBridge","bgArt":"battleshipbridge","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["redhood","liliweiss"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_2","text":"We'll be at Elysion's 3rd Nikke Research Lab in about an hour. Is everyone prepared?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_redash_alldownhill","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_3","text":"What's there to prepare? What's so different from us making a typical visit?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_4","text":"If we landed directly by the lab, the Raptures would swarm and encircle us, so we'll be landing nearby and going in on foot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_5","text":"... I guess I need to prepare.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_6","text":"Snow White went into the workshop last night and she's still there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_7","text":"Looks like you had some trouble comforting her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_8","text":"Yeah.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_9","text":"After all, this is my first time dying so I didn't exactly know how to console her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_10","text":"I wasn't sure if I should be sitting around wailing with grief or pensively reflecting on all the good times.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_11","text":"I figured neither was the right approach, so I went with giving her a gift.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_12","text":"She refused to take it and ran off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_13","text":"I can see why she refused it. It probably felt like you were giving her a keepsake after your death.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_14","text":"So what do you want me to do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_15","text":"Did she say anything else?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_16","text":"She kept urging me to stay here, and not to return to my hometown.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_17","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_18","text":"Is that something you would ever consider?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_19","text":"Lady Liliweiss, I've already told you: I don't fit in here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_20","text":"I'm no \"Goddess\".","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_21","text":"I spent my entire life ambling about the streets without any purpose and nearly got myself killed as a result. Now I've got everyone telling me that I'm special.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_22","text":"I was turned into a Nikke and sent here for no apparent reason.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_23","text":"You're one of the youngest ace pilots in the history of aerial combat. \nRapunzel could have been the next powerful religious leader.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_24","text":"Dorothy is the daughter of a reputable politician. Then you've got Snow White and her superhuman knack for developing weapons. I can't even pretend to be on your level.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_25","text":"Scarlet is the only one amongst us who I can possibly compare with.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_26","text":"Even then though, now that I think about it, she's a gifted swordsperson.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_27","text":"A street urchin from the filthy back alleys couldn't possibly hope to compare to all of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_28","text":"Well, from the way I see it, I don't think there's anyone better suited to be a goddess than you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_29","text":"I see you're getting better at sarcasm.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_30","text":"If you don't see it that way, then there's nothing I can do to convince you otherwise.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_31","text":"But we all think that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_32","text":"Why do you think Snow White keeps begging you to stay here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_33","text":"You're more qualified to stay here than any of us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_34","text":"So I suggest you reconsider.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_35","text":"You should be spending as much time with those close to you as possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_36","text":"No can do. I've got to go back to my hometown. That's where my story ends.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_37","text":"Accompanied by an old soundtrack from back in the day.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_38","text":"If that's what you want, I won't stop you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_39","text":"But ask yourself,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_40","text":"is going back to your hometown what you really want to do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_41","text":"... What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_42","text":"Hehe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_43","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_43","text":"Liliweiss walks off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_44","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_45","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_45","text":"1 hour later.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["liliweiss"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_46","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_46","text":"In the skies above Elysion's 3rd Nikke Research Lab's periphery.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_redash_goddesssquadready","movie":null,"shown":["snowwhite_o","rapunzel_o","dorothy","commander"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_47","text":"We've reached the drop-off point.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_48","text":"Does everyone have parachutes?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_49","text":"Of course.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_50","text":"Did all of you memorize the coordinates?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_51","text":"Yes. No problem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_52","text":"All right then, whoever's ready can jump out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_53","text":"I'll go first. See you all in a bit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_54","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_54","text":"Liliweiss leaps out of the plane without a parachute.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_55","text":"I figured she'd go first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_03_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_03_s_56","text":"She should be able to break through the atmosphere without any additi